      "created_at": "2019-07-10T20:24:39Z",
      "updated_at": "2019-07-10T20:24:39Z",
      "body": "For the first phase of this, we would like to send people a copy of their application.\r\n\r\nThe second phase of this will require more consideration from The Carpentries instructor training team.  We can currently view [possible duplicate training requests](https://amy.carpentries.org/reports/duplicate_training_requests/) but we need to figure out what to do with them.  We don't necessarily want to merge them because the second application may reflect not just changes in basic information like contact information but also changes in experiences and skill set that they want reflected. ",
